WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:03.200
Good!

00:04.200 --> 00:05.680
General Shi Lang is indeed a man of swift action.

00:05.760 --> 00:07.160
General, please rise.

00:07.760 --> 00:09.760
However, I have one condition—

00:09.920 --> 00:12.200
The imperial jade seal of the realm.

00:12.920 --> 00:14.320
That jade seal?

00:14.520 --> 00:17.187
I lost it back when I was driven out.

00:17.400 --> 00:18.320
As of now,

00:18.400 --> 00:20.400
Even I don't know where it ended up.

00:22.200 --> 00:23.600
Never mind, then.

00:24.120 --> 00:25.520
Men!

00:26.000 --> 00:27.400
Provide the general with weapons and provisions.

00:27.520 --> 00:28.920
Furthermore, I shall grant him

00:29.000 --> 00:30.800
Two hundred suits of armor.

00:31.400 --> 00:32.400
General,

00:32.560 --> 00:34.560
You must hold off the Qingzhou Army for me!

00:34.760 --> 00:35.760
Your Highness,

00:35.840 --> 00:37.440
Just await my good news!

00:43.500 --> 00:48.500
Having obtained so many weapons and supplies, Shi Lang suddenly realized he might have an opportunity to achieve great ambitions.

00:49.000 --> 00:55.000
Thereupon, they immediately reneged on their pledge, turning instead to attack the Wuyang and Yiyang regions with no intention whatsoever of obstructing the Qingzhou Army.

00:55.500 --> 01:00.500
Although Zhu Yuanzhi led a detachment to cover the rear and stall the enemy, their numbers were simply too few...

01:01.000 --> 01:04.500
A few days later, the main force of the Qingzhou Army caught up with you after all, and you were forced to engage them.

01:04.920 --> 01:08.240
After days of bitter, unrelenting fighting, still unable to secure victory,

01:08.320 --> 01:10.520
The army's morale collapsed completely.

01:10.800 --> 01:13.800
Terrified of future execution and purges by the imperial court,

01:13.880 --> 01:15.120
The soldiers defected one after another.

01:15.280 --> 01:18.160
You tragically perished amidst the chaotic rout of your broken army.
